# Morven Student — Frontend environment configuration
#
# Copy this file to `.env` for local development and adjust as needed.
# The `.env` file is git-ignored and MUST NOT be committed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VITE_API_URL — the backend API base URL used by the frontend.
#
# DEVELOPMENT (default): point at your local backend.
#   VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3001
#
# PRODUCTION: the frontend intentionally uses SAME-ORIGIN requests (empty
# base URL). Vercel proxies "/api/*" and "/uploads/*" to the Railway backend
# via `vercel.json`, which keeps auth cookies first-party (CSRF + httpOnly
# refresh-token flow) and avoids mixed content. Do NOT set VITE_API_URL to
# the Railway domain in a production build.
#
# TEST: vitest injects its own value; this variable is ignored.

# VITE_API_URL=